codex
The scan found why there was no cut ring: the initial hair rule was swallowing the lower central neck/bust because its `neck_core` protection stopped at raw z = −0.60, while the supplied hidden collar base maps to raw z ≈ −0.807. I’m extending only the protected central neck core to raw z = −0.92; side hair still requires the same dark/warm texels plus outside-core geometry. This should create a real central skin/garment intersection while leaving full-length side locks and braids in the hair partition.
apply patch
